      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Little அணிப்புள்ளே; little coconut-palm one;",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The opening folk endearments (`அணிப்புள்ளே; தென்னம் புள்ளே; கிளிப்புள்ளே; கிரிப்புள்ளே`) are highly idiomatic. English preserves the cumulative folk-call pattern and leaves the first opaque term in Tamil script rather than inventing a false meaning.",
          "Item-level lyric authorship remains unresolved; the film-level `பாடல்கள்: கவிஞர் வாலி` credit is not promoted to this occurrence."
        ]
      }
